cture.</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-amber-100/50\" data-kid=\"163\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-amber-600\" data-kid=\"164\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle text-xl\" data-kid=\"165\"></i>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"166\">Gaps</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-[#003153]/80\" data-kid=\"167\">\n                                    <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"168\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"169\"></span>No direct experience with Supply Chain niche.</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex gap-4 pt-2\" data-kid=\"170\">\n                            <button class=\"flex-1 py-4 px-8 rounded-[1.25rem] bg-[#003153] text-white font-extrabold text-sm hover:bg-[#00223a] transition-all shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group/btn\" data-kid=\"171\">\n                                Explore Profile <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"172\"></i>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"py-4 px-8 rounded-[1.25rem] border-2 border-[#003153]/10 text-[#003153] font-extrabold text-sm hover:bg-[#F8F8FF] transition-all\" data-kid=\"173\">Add to Pool</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <div class=\"bg-white border border-[#003153]/5 rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 flex flex-col gap-6 shadow-soft hover:shadow-2xl ho