  <div class=\"h-1.5 w-full bg-[#003153]/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"204\">\n                                            <div class=\"h-full bg-[#43B3AE] rounded-full\" style=\"width: 82%\" data-kid=\"205\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"space-y-1.5\" data-kid=\"206\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[11px] font-bold text-[#003153]\" data-kid=\"207\">\n                                            <span data-kid=\"208\">Semantic Similarity</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-[#43B3AE]\" data-kid=\"209\">0.88</span>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"h-1.5 w-full bg-[#003153]/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"210\">\n                                            <div class=\"h-full bg-[#43B3AE] rounded-full\" style=\"width: 88%\" data-kid=\"211\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"space-y-1.5\" data-kid=\"212\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[11px] font-bold text-[#003153]\" data-kid=\"213\">\n                                            <span data-kid=\"214\">Feature Boost</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-[#43B3AE]\" data-kid=\"215\">+8%</span>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"h-1.5 w-full bg-[#003153]/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"216\">\n                                            <div class=\"h-full bg-[#43B3AE] rounded-full\" style=\"width: 45%\" data-kid=\"217\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"space-y-1.5\" data-kid=\"218\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[11px] font-bold text-[#003153]\" data-kid=\"219\">\n                                            <span data-kid=\"220\">Reranker Score</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-[#43B3AE]\" data-kid=\"221\">0.84</span>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"h-1.5 w-full bg-[#003153]/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"222\">\n                                            <div class=\"h-full bg-[#43B3AE] rounded-full\" style=\"width: 84%\" data-kid=\"223\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </details>\n\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-5\" data-kid=\"224\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#43B3AE]/5 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-[#43B3AE]/10\" data-kid=\"225\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-[#43B3AE]\" data-kid=\"226\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-circle-check text-xl\" data-kid=\"227\"></i>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"228\">Strengths</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-[#003153]/80\" data-kid=\"229\">\n                                    <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"230\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#43B3AE] shrink-0\" data-kid=\"231\"></span>Highly specialized in Design Systems.</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"bg-amber-50/50 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-amber-100/50\" data-kid=\"232\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-amber-600\" data-kid=\"233\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle text-xl\" data-kid=\"234\"></i>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"235\">Gaps</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-[#003153]/80\" data-kid=\"236\">\n                                    <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"237\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"238\"></span>Limited Node.js/Go experience.</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-4 pt-2\" data-kid=\"239\">\n                            <button class=\"flex-1 py-4 px-8 rounded-[1.25rem] bg-[#003153] text-white font-extrabold text-sm hover:bg-[#00223a] transition-all shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group/btn\" data-kid=\"240\">\n                                Explore Profile <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"241\"></i>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"py-4 px-8 rounded-[1.25rem] border-2 border-[#003153]/10 text-[#003153] font-extrabold text-sm hover:bg-[#F8F8FF] transition-all\" data-kid=\"242\">Add to Pool</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            \n            <aside class=\"w-[35%] flex flex-col h-fit relative\" data-kid=\"243\">\n                <div class=\"glass-panel min-h-[800px] flex flex-col rounded-[3rem] border border-white/40 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"244\">\n                    <div class=\"p-8 border-b border-[#003153]/5 flex items-center justify-between bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-xl\" data-kid=\"245\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"246\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#003153] flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-xl shadow-[#003153]/30\" data-kid=\"247\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-robot text-3xl\" data-kid=\"248\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"249\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-extrabold font-heading text-[#003153]\" data-kid=\"250\">Recruiter Copilot</h3>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"251\">\n                                    <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#43B3AE] animate-pulse\" data-kid=\"252\"></span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#43B3AE] font-black uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"253\">Always Vetting</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/40 flex items-center justify-center text-[#003153]/40 hover:text-[#003153] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"254\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-settings text-xl\" data-kid=\"255\"></i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 p-8 overflow-y-auto space-y-8 no-scrollbar scroll-smooth\" data-kid=\"256\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-start max-w-[90%]\" data-kid=\"257\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-[2rem] rounded-tl-none shadow-sm border border-[#003153]/5\" data-kid=\"258\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#003153] font-medium\" data-kid=\"259\">Hello Alex! I've analyzed 48 profiles and ranked <span class=\"text-[#43B3AE] font-bold\" data-kid=\"260\">14 candidates</span>. Sarah Jenkins is the strongest fit based on recent Stripe leadership.</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] text-[#003153]/30 mt-4 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"261\">Assistant • 10:24 AM</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-end ml-auto max-w-[90%]\" data-kid=\"262\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#43B3AE] p-6 rounded-[2rem] rounded-tr-none shadow-xl shadow-[#43B3AE]/20\" data-kid=\"263\">\n                                <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-white font-medium\" data-kid=\"264\">Explain why Sarah is ranked #1. Show me the technical pipeline scores.</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] text-white/50 mt-4 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-right\" data-kid=\"265\">Recruiter • 10:25 AM</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-start max-w-[90%]\" data-kid=\"266\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-white/60 p-5 rounded-3xl rounded-tl-none shadow-sm border border-[#003153]/5 backdrop-blur-sm\" data-kid=\"267\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\" data-kid=\"268\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-bulb text-[#43B3AE] text-lg\" data-kid=\"269\"></i>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-[#003153]/40 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"270\">AI Insight</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#003153] font-medium\" data-kid=\"271\">Sarah has a <span class=\"font-bold\" data-kid=\"272\">Semantic Similarity of 0.94</span> and a high <span class=\"font-bold\" data-kid=\"273\">Reranker Score</span>. You can now see the detailed breakdown directly on her card by clicking the <span class=\"text-[#43B3AE] font-bold\" data-kid=\"274\">Ranking Explanation</span> button.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2\" data-kid=\"275\">\n                            <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/40 border border-[#003153]/5 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-bold text-[#003153] hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"276\">Refine for React Native?</button>\n                            <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/40 border border-[#003153]/5 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-bold text-[#003153] hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"277\">Check Salary Fit</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-8 bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-xl border-t border-[#003153]/5\" data-kid=\"278\">\n                        <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"279\">\n                            <textarea placeholder=\"Ask Copilot to analyze candidates...\" rows=\"1\" class=\"w-full pl-6 pr-16 py-4 bg-white border border-[#003153]/10 rounded-2xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-[#43B3AE]/10 transition-all text-sm font-medium resize-none shadow-inner\" data-kid=\"280\"></textarea>\n                            <button class=\"absolute right-3 top-2.5 w-11 h-11 bg-[#003153] text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-[#43B3AE] hover:shadow-lg transition-all active:scale-95\" data-kid=\"281\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-send text-xl\" data-kid=\"282\"></i>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </aside>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n",
